version: "0.3.0"
abstract: >
  Interactive Arctic vs Antarctic sea-ice albedo sandbox using published
  constants from arctic-climate-utac (P127) and antarctic-ice-shelf-utac
  (P120): Duspayev et al. 2024, Zhang et al. 2025, Riihelä et al. 2021.
keywords:
  - sea ice
  - albedo
  - Arctic
  - Antarctic
  - ice-albedo feedback
